Cell["\<\
Q3 functions that are useful to construct a linear combination of unitary \
operators.\
\>", "TechNoteCaption",
 CellID->1909264679,ExpressionUUID->"8acdc86b-5edc-4b1d-b69d-fdffd1e0d59e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Make sure that the ",
