  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->"paclet:QuantumMob/Q3/guide/Q3"],
 " package is loaded to use the demonstrations in this documentation:"
}], "TechNoteMathCaption",
 CellID->1428640008,ExpressionUUID->"afa42193-2427-42b6-942c-e67c615ff612"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<QuantumMob`Q3`\>\"", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",
 CellID->853967906,ExpressionUUID->"20b29657-a974-4775-8a20-2a1d24d86b7f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["General Implementation", "TechNoteSection",
 CellID->221637712,ExpressionUUID->"e0ca2066-925c-49da-81c9-8f3bfd440a8c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Let ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["U", "1"], ",", 
    SubscriptBox["U", "2"], ",", "\[Ellipsis]"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"afd7670d-2e00-4754-8ac6-738133a1915e"],
 " be unitary operators and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", ":=", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "1"], ",", 
      SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "2"], ",", "\[Ellipsis]"}], ")"}]}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"c2b0bae5-b51d-4614-be09-0cb54c3de022"],
 " be a vector of complex numbers.  We want to implement a linear combination \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"T", ":=", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[Sum]", "k"], 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "k"], 
      SubscriptBox["U", "k"]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "37db9df2-9f41-44fc-860f-a9e0a9bcf46c"],
 " of those unitary operators. Since ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["T", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7c586a90-8da2-4038-a6bc-591c795ed849"],
 " is not unitary in general, ancillary qubits are necessary."
}], "TechNoteText",
 CellID->2083809428,ExpressionUUID->"e7adcf1f-9081-4d1f-89dc-12aac3b3850b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "One way to implement ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["T", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "dc413977-9c4a-41bd-a53c-5c30cd64620b"],
 " is through the quantum circuit shown in ",
 ButtonBox["Figure 1",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->
   "paclet:QuantumMob/Q3/tutorial/LinearCombinationOfUnitaries#1051781767"],
 ", where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["V", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6ec7eb18-608d-4aad-87d3-5be0e16c6981"],
 " is a unitary operator with the first column stores the coefficients ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "k"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "11c7169d-b325-47b1-b456-65849989224c"],
 " as follows:"
}], "TechNoteText",
 CellID->786839548,ExpressionUUID->"3f41b28f-b989-4571-ab10-f982022c3542"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"V", "\[DotEqual]", 
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox["1", 
      SqrtBox[
       RowBox[{"\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]", 
        RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", 
         SubscriptBox["\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]", "1"]}]}]]], 
     RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
        {
         SqrtBox[
          SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "1"]], "*", "\[Ellipsis]", "*"},
        {
         SqrtBox[
          SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "2"]], "*", "\[Ellipsis]", "*"},
        {"\[VerticalEllipsis]", "\[VerticalEllipsis]", 
         "\[DescendingEllipsis]", "\[VerticalEllipsis]"},
        {"\[VerticalEllipsis]", "*", "\[Ellipsis]", "*"}
       }], ")"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5214ffe3-110f-4b4b-8878-89b93c1073b5"],
 " ."
}], "TechNoteText",
 CellID->1421741120,ExpressionUUID->"95c9d3e0-48dc-4421-bc30-dbdadf956a8c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "More specifically, for given coefficients ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", ":=", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "1"], ",", 
      SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "2"], ",", "\[Ellipsis]"}], ")"}]}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"ceaa4342-2b76-4668-8556-dc7f810f06a0"],
 ", the unitary operator ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["V", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4b59a7ca-b556-4574-86ee-31d7c5c1e3c9"],
 " may be implemented by the ",
 ButtonBox["amplitude encoding gate",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->"paclet:QuantumMob/Q3/ref/AmplitudeEncoding"],
 ". The desired operation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["T", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "132d70be-0618-4158-8b96-471547496c69"],
 " is achieved when the ancillary register is measured with all qubits in the \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[{"0"},
    "Ket"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "26d63583-1da0-48cd-9948-901b79662a18"],
 " state; if not, the procedure fails and must be attempted again. The \
success probability is given by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[{"\[Psi]"},
     "Bra"], 
    SuperscriptBox["T", "\[Dagger]"], "T", 
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{"\[Psi]"},
      "Ket"], "/", 
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      RowBox[{
      "\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]", "\[Alpha]", 
       "\[RightDoubleBracketingBar]"}], "1", "2"]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"ab296502-4ea7-4314-a77c-e978e8a75a33"],
 ". Therefore, the maximum success probability is limited by the squared norm \
of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["T", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bab9fbe3-84f1-4e1f-8451-dcace7e59003"],
 "; that is, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{
     "\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]", "T", "\[RightDoubleBracketingBar]"}], "2", 
     "2"], "/", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{
     "\[LeftDoubleBracketingBar]", "\[Alpha]", 
      "\[RightDoubleBracketingBar]"}], "1", "2"]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"116c3aa4-4d13-43de-a739-e6f40c88a0bd"],
 "."
}], "TechNoteText",
 CellID->1718500619,ExpressionUUID->"bb45db1e-6ca3-41fc-9aac-9bdeeccda6a9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  GraphicsBox[{
    {Dashing[{Small, Small}], 
     LineBox[{{{5, -1}, {6, -1}}, {{5, -2}, {6, -2}}}]}, 
    LineBox[{{{0, -1}, {5, -1}}, {{0, -2}, {5, -2}}, {{0, -4}, {6, -4}}}], {
     InsetBox[
      TemplateBox[{"0"},
